<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>180 formless 0.1 sens in roblox and 2200 dpi on mouse ( locked roblox ( the blue lock gameand the macro allows you to make a perfect 180 formless, but provided that you have a dpi of 0.1 in the roblox and a dpi of 2200 on the mouse</Description>
